  "gaps": [
    "The capture uses the unit \"credits\" without stating semester or quarter. \"semester\" is assumed and should be confirmed.",
    "EDU 100 (3 credits) is listed once under core. The capture says it also satisfies the Social Scientist Perspective Foundations requirement: \"In this program, 3 credits from the core may also satisfy Global Campus Foundations requirements.\"",
    "GEN 101 is labeled \"Entry Point Course (Elective)\". The capture does not explicitly say whether its 3 credits count within the 13-credit Elective Requirements block. The printed arithmetic suggests they do: 30 listed Foundations credits + 24 core + 13 elective = 67. As printed, line items total 70, so the overlap needs confirmation.",
    "The capture does not specify which courses may fill the remaining elective credits.",
    "Residency rule: \"At least 18 credits earned toward the Associate of Arts degree must be completed at the University of Arizona Global Campus.\" No specific course is designated as institution-only.",
    "\"Additional prerequisite courses may be required\". The capture does not identify which ones.",
    "Minimum cumulative GPA of 2.00 in all coursework attempted at the University is required. This is not a course requirement."
  ],
